# DebDroid provenance manifest
#
# Every file in the repository that is not source code is recorded here. CI
# verifies each checksum and fails on any binary that has no entry, so the set
# cannot grow again without being written down.
#
# Tiers, in decreasing order of what can be proven about a file:
#
#   A  Built from source in this repository
#   B  Built from a documented, pinned recipe
#   C  Third-party prebuilt, provenance recorded but not reproducible here
#
# Tier C is what the "open source but ships closed blobs" criticism is about,
# and the goal is to empty it. See docs/reference/third-party.md.
#
# Format, one record per line, fields separated by "|":
#   path | tier | sha256 | bytes | license | upstream | recipe-or-notes

